    "detailed_description": "&quot;Pablo Let's Go Bar&quot; is an online co-op/single-player roguelike first person shooter, join Pablo and his hermanos and hermanas in their journey to V\u00e1squez's fiesta, or will Pablo go it alone?<br><br>Pick your playstyle and go through unique levels to maybe get a sip of that rumored, groundbreaking, mouthwatering, mystery drink at the fiesta or succumb to the ghosts from Pablo's past.<br><br><strong>Punchy Gunplay</strong><br>Fast gunplay is a usual for Pablo and his friends.<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676180/extras/47516d4a68cacd7b84c556b52e87451e.poster.avif?t=1681364931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676180/extras/47516d4a68cacd7b84c556b52e87451e.webm?t=1681364931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676180/extras/47516d4a68cacd7b84c556b52e87451e.mp4?t=1681364931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Aggressive Combat</strong><br>Unleash your RAGE using powerful weapons.<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676180/extras/f03a2ed58d106389a7ada798e7070b88.poster.avif?t=1681364931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676180/extras/f03a2ed58d106389a7ada798e7070b88.webm?t=1681364931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676180/extras/f03a2ed58d106389a7ada798e7070b88.mp4?t=1681364931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Guns and Unlockable Content</strong><br>The game offers you different weapons, therefore playstyles.<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted lo